Package: tll-mutator
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, libtll0 (>= 0.4), libtll-lua
Replaces: tui-patch, mutator
Breaks: tui-patch, mutator
Description: TUI viewer and editor for TLL data files (terminal only).
 mutator (tll-mutator) shows TLL capture files (*.dat) in a table with filtering and
 search using the same Lua engine as tll-read. It supports large files,
 sessions, and preparing field and stream edits, committed to a new file
 or in place with a backup.
 .
 This build provides only the terminal (TUI) interface and
 non-interactive dump mode. No GUI dependencies. `mutator --serve ADDR`
 starts a read-only HTTP server (REST + SSE) for testers.
 .
 See also: tll-read(1).
